  "content": "<h1 id=\"hello-and-welcome\">哈囉，歡迎來到 Bloxy 的結構世界！</h1>\n<h4>這個模組新增了一個名為「冒險領域」的全新維度。<br>在該維度中，你將會發現新的結構、新的 Boss 以及要面對的敵人，當然了。<br>如果你成功挑戰，你將獲得全新的物品和工具，助你在旅途上更上一層樓！</h4>\n<p>可以參考圖片看看一些結構和維度的樣子 — <em>（適用於模組版本 1.15 及以上）</em><br>如果你好奇，光影包叫做「Complementary Unbound」。</p>\n\n## \n<details>\n<summary>影片</summary>\n\n<p><span class=\"mce-preview-object mce-object-iframe\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-mce-object=\"iframe\" data-mce-p-allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" data-mce-p-src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/F71A4cp9Rrg\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/F71A4cp9Rrg\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" data-mce-src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/F71A4cp9Rrg\"></iframe><span class=\"mce-shim\"></span></span><br><span contenteditable=\"false\" data-mce-object=\"iframe\" class=\"mce-preview-object mce-object-iframe\" data-mce-p-allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" data-mce-p-src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/YxbXoxsU3Yc\"><iframe width=\"560\" height=\"314\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/YxbXoxsU3Yc\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" frameborder=\"0\"></iframe><span class=\"mce-shim\"></span></span><br><span contenteditable=\"false\" data-mce-object=\"iframe\" class=\"mce-preview-object mce-object-iframe\" data-mce-p-allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" data-mce-p-src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/syjBaUHcD0w\"><iframe width=\"560\" height=\"314\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/syjBaUHcD0w\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" frameborder=\"0\"></iframe><span class=\"mce-shim\"></span></span><br><span contenteditable=\"false\" data-mce-object=\"iframe\" class=\"mce-preview-object mce-object-iframe\" data-mce-p-allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" data-mce-p-src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/7OcNTVK_oIg\"><iframe width=\"560\" height=\"314\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/7OcNTVK_oIg\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" frameborder=\"0\"></iframe><span class=\"mce-shim\"></span></span><span contenteditable=\"false\" data-mce-object=\"iframe\" class=\"mce-preview-object mce-object-iframe\" data-mce-p-allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" data-mce-p-src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/WlVxQsOoFTc\"><iframe width=\"560\" height=\"314\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/WlVxQsOoFTc\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" frameborder=\"0\"></iframe><span class=\"mce-shim\"></span></span></p>\n\n</details>\n\n## \n\n<p><strong>- 其他詳細資訊 -<br></strong>此模組可放入任何模組包中，無論是個人用途還是商業用途均適用。<br>本模組使用 MCreator 和 Blockbench 製作。</p>",
